OL,3,AMurder investigation after man found
OL,4,Adead and child seriously injured
OL,5,
OL,6,FA murder investigation has been
OL,7,Flaunched after a man was found dead
OL,8,Falongside a seriously injured child in
OL,9,FCounty Tyrone on Saturday morning.
OL,11,FA male has been arrested on suspicion
OL,12,Fof murder and attempted murder and
OL,13,Fremains in custody.
OL,15,FThe incident took place in Lisnahull
OL,16,FRoad in Dungannon.
OL,18,FThe child was taken to the Royal
OL,19,FBelfast Hospital for Sick Children.
